{"id":"0712d19732fa81e7","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-derivation-length.md","title":"Derivation Length","display":"df-derivation-length — Derivation Length","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-derivation-length","aliases":["72-df-derivation-length"],"display":"df-derivation-length — Derivation Length","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §1.2.5 print13/PDF25; local measures, not source strong-inference count","verification_status":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-derivation-length"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-derivation-length</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-derivation-length — Derivation Length"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §1.2.5 print13/PDF25; local measures, not source strong-inference count"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked; explicit local encoding checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\">\\(\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)\\)</span>；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\pi|:=|D|,\\qquad\\operatorname{depth}(\\pi):=\\sup\\{|u|+1:u\\in D\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{width}(\\pi):=\\sup\\{|I_D(u)|:u\\in D\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\pi|:=|D|,\\qquad\\operatorname{depth}(\\pi):=\\sup\\{|u|+1:u\\in D\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{width}(\\pi):=\\sup\\{|I_D(u)|:u\\in D\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>depth按节点数计长度，单节点证明为1；height另按边的良基秩计，单节点为0。有限D时都是自然数；可数D时节点数、深度和分支度至多ω。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle$ 及 $\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle$ 满足 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的 $\\operatorname{DerivationTree}(D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta)$；所有投影在这个五元对象上取值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi=\\langle D,